            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markii qof madax ahu dembaabo oo uu kama' u sameeyo mid ka mid ah waxyaalihii Rabbiga Ilaahiisa ahu uu amray inaan la samayn, oo uu saas eed ku leeyahay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
