        {
          "text": "Oo dadka dhulka mid ka mid ahu hadduu kama' ku dembaabo, oo uu sameeyo wax ka mid ah waxyaalihii uu Rabbigu amray inaan la samayn, oo uu saas eed ku leeyahay, ",
